Vice Governor</b>

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:44.180
Since Kagawa doesn't get much rain,

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:46.430
there are many bodies of water like this.

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.550
I used to visit them often to fish.

00:22:48.550 --> 00:22:50.080
